padmin	source\rtsetup.src	0	string	RID_RTS_COMMANDPAGE	RID_RTS_CMD_STR_PDFHELP			50	en-GB	The command line for PDF converters is executed as follows: for each document printed, "(TMP)" in the command line is replaced by a temporary file and "(OUTFILE)" in the command line is replaced by the target PDF file name. If "(TMP)" is in the command line, the PostScript code will be supplied via a file, otherwise via standard input (i.e. as a pipe).				20130618 17:22:18
