padmin	source\rtsetup.src	0	string	RID_RTS_COMMANDPAGE	RID_RTS_CMD_STR_FAXHELP			50	en-GB	The command line for fax devices is executed as follows: for each fax sent, "(TMP)" in the command line is replaced by a temporary file and "(PHONE)" in the command line is replaced by the fax number. If "(TMP)" appears in the command line, the PostScript code will be supplied via a file, otherwise it is passed as standard input (i.e. as a pipe).				20130618 17:22:18
