helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu from which you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spell checking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialogue box with more options.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
