helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id7911008				0	en-GB	Click a chart to edit the object properties:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id9844660				0	en-GB	Size and position on the current page.				20130618 17:22:18
