helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id2350840				0	en-GB	Chart data values (for charts with own data).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3776055				0	en-GB	Chart type, axes, titles, walls, grid, and more.				20130618 17:22:18
