helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433835				0	en-GB	The Formatting Bar is shown when a chart is set to edit mode. Double-click a chart to enter edit mode. Click outside the chart to leave edit mode.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433878				0	en-GB	You can edit the formatting of a chart using the controls and icons on the Formatting Bar.				20130618 17:22:18
