helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200902300479				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the element from the chart that you want to format. The element gets selected in the chart preview. Click Format Selection to open the properties dialogue box for the selected element.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
