helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338	2			0	en-GB	The default toolbars available when working with an activated formula document in $[officename] Math are described here. You can customise the toolbars to meet your requirements by moving, deleting or adding new icons. Please note that when you modify the toolbars, the configuration no longer corresponds to the description here.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Status Bar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150749	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/smath/main0202.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id3083278	2			0	en-GB	The status bar displays information about the active document.				20130618 17:22:18
