helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151074	2			0	en-GB	$[officename] Impress lets you create professional slide shows that can include charts, drawing objects, text, multimedia and a variety of other items. If you want, you can even import and modify Microsoft PowerPoint presentations.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379	3			0	en-GB	For on-screen slide shows, animation, slide transitions and multimedia are a few of the techniques you can use to make your presentation more exciting.				20130618 17:22:18
