helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150208	12			0	en-GB	Creating Slides				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3153247	13			0	en-GB	$[officename] Impress provides you with templates to create professional-looking slides.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610	14			0	en-GB	You can also assign a number of dynamic effects to your slides, including animation and transition effects.				20130618 17:22:18
