helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917	16			0	en-GB	Several views or pages are available when you design a slide show. For example, the Slide Sorter displays an overview of your slides in thumbnail form, while the Handout page contains both the slide and the text you want to distribute to the audience.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3148608	17			0	en-GB	$[officename] Impress also lets you rehearse the timing of your slide show.				20130618 17:22:18
