helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762	68			0	en-GB	The functions provided allow you to edit the points of a curve or an object converted to a curve. The following icons are available:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105	42			0	en-GB	Edit Points				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151	43			0	en-GB	The \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Points\"\>\<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\>\</link\> icon allows you to activate or deactivate the edit mode for Bézier objects. In the edit mode, individual points of the drawing object can be selected.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3153951\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectbeziermode.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153951\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
