helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	42			0	en-GB	Activate the \<emph\>AutoSpellCheck\</emph\> icon on the Standard bar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155569	33			0	en-GB	Right-click a word with a red wavy underline, and then choose a suggested replacement word from the list, or from the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> sub-menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759	6			0	en-GB	If you choose a word from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>AutoCorrect\</item\> sub-menu, the underlined word and the replacement word are automatically added to the AutoCorrect list for the current language. To view the AutoCorrect list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Replace\</item\> tab.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147819	7			0	en-GB	You can also add the underlined word to your custom dictionary by choosing \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147220	32			0	en-GB	To Exclude Words From the Spell check				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147263	35			0	en-GB	Select the words that you want to exclude.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282	36			0	en-GB	Click the Language control on the Status bar to open a menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3145602	38			0	en-GB	Choose “None (Do not check spelling)”.				20130618 17:22:18
