helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155160	62			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Macro from\</emph\> list, double-click "%PRODUCTNAME Macros - Gimmicks".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277	63			0	en-GB	Select "AutoText" and then click \<emph\>Run\</emph\>. A list of the current AutoText entries is generated in a separate text document.				20130618 17:22:18
