helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147775	15			0	en-GB	Click in the first cell of the series you want to sum up, drag to the final cell, and then release.\<br/\>$[officename] inserts a formula for calculating the sum of the values in the current column.				20130618 17:22:18
