helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9147007				0	en-GB	Check \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Search for Styles\</item\>.\<br/\>The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Search for\</item\> text box now is a list box, from which where you can select any of the Paragraph Styles that are applied in the current document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id679342				0	en-GB	Select the style to search for, then click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> or \<emph\>Find All\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
