helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id8087405				0	en-GB	You want to find all text in your document to which a certain direct character formatting is assigned.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id3406170				0	en-GB	Finding formats only finds direct character attributes, it does not find attributes applied as part of a style.				20130618 17:22:18
