helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219	27			0	en-GB	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before\</item\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
