helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527	5			0	en-GB	Apply the paragraph style that you defined for chapter titles to the chapter headings in your document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153729	6			0	en-GB	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Header\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Footer\</item\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the sub-menu.				20130618 17:22:18
