helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153175	10			0	en-GB	Click "Chapter" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and "Chapter number and name" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
