helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103	2			0	en-GB	You can use fields and sections to hide or display text in your document if a condition is met.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409	19			0	en-GB	Before you can hide text, you must first create a variable to use in the condition for hiding the text.				20130618 17:22:18
