helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153131	20			0	en-GB	Click in your document and choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640	21			0	en-GB	Click the \<emph\>Variables\</emph\> tab and click "Set Variable" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	22			0	en-GB	Click "General" in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620	23			0	en-GB	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149869	24			0	en-GB	Enter a value for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108	25			0	en-GB	To hide the variable in your document, select \<emph\>Invisible\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585	26			0	en-GB	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156245	27			0	en-GB	To Hide Text				20130618 17:22:18
