helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	en-GB	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for the current paragraph or for all selected paragraphs. You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
