helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id4313791				0	en-GB	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id4331797				0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
