helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id2318796				0	en-GB	Now your title page has the style "First Page", and the next pages automatically have the "Default" style.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id399182				0	en-GB	You can now for example insert a footer for the "Default" page style only, or insert footers in both page styles, but with differently formatted page number fields.				20130618 17:22:18
