helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id95828				0	en-GB	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Insert Break\</emph\> dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3496200				0	en-GB	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> list box, select a page style. You may set a new page number, too. Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
