helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156252	16			0	en-GB	To apply the custom page style to a single page, select the default page style that is used in your document in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
