helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155916	1			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"removing_line_breaks\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/removing_line_breaks.xhp\"\>Removing Line Breaks\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858	2			0	en-GB	Use the AutoCorrect feature to remove line breaks that occur within sentences. Unwanted line breaks can occur when you copy text from another source and paste it into a text document.				20130618 17:22:18
