helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\resize_navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861	27			0	en-GB	To dock or undock the Navigator or the Styles and Formatting window, hold down the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> key and double-click on a grey area in the window. Alternatively, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Shift+F10\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
