helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153120	18			0	en-GB	To convert a section into normal text, click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149631	19			0	en-GB	To make a section read-only, select the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Write Protection\</emph\> area.				20130618 17:22:18
