helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917	26			0	en-GB	You can insert new sections, or links to sections in other documents into the current document. If you insert a section as a link, the content of the link changes when you modify the source document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155863	27			0	en-GB	To Insert a New Section				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149843	23			0	en-GB	Click in your document where you want to insert a new section, or select the text that you want to convert to a section.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156103	28			0	en-GB	If you select some text that occurs within a paragraph, the text is automatically converted into a new paragraph.				20130618 17:22:18
