helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	42			0	en-GB	You can quickly apply styles, such as paragraph and character styles, in your document by using the Fill Format Mode in the Styles and Formatting window.				20130618 17:22:18
