helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id1211890				0	en-GB	You can select adjacent cells, then merge them into a single cell. Conversely, you can take a large cell and divide it into individual cells.				20130618 17:22:18
