helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	6			0	en-GB	To delete the contents of a table, click in the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A until all cells are selected, and then press Delete or Backspace.				20130618 17:22:18
