helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145080	18			0	en-GB	You can only animate text that is contained in a drawing object, such as rectangles, lines, or text objects. For example, draw a rectangle, then double-click the rectangle and enter your text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811	19			0	en-GB	Select the drawing object containing the text that you want to animate.				20130618 17:22:18
