helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id1120200910485775				0	en-GB	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Character\</item\>, click the Font Effects tab, then select the type of capitalisation in the Effects box. "Capitals" capitalises all letters. "Title" capitalises the first letter of each word. "Small capitals" capitalises all letters, but in a reduced font size.				20130618 17:22:18
