helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153268				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3153275\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20174.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153275\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
