helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10885				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select this icon to browse through incorrect table formulae.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
