helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"bereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditRegion\"\>Changes the properties of sections defined in your document.\</ahelp\> To insert a section, select text or click in your document, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143275	3			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Edit Sections\</emph\> dialogue box is similar to the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04020100.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Section\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue box, and offers the following additional options:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149820	4			0	en-GB	Section				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149104	5			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Type the name of the section that you want to edit, or click a name in the \<emph\>Section\</emph\> list.\</ahelp\> If the cursor is currently in a section, the section name is displayed on the right side of the status bar at the bottom of the document window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040	6			0	en-GB	The current write protection status of a section is indicated by the lock symbol in front of the section name in the list. An open lock is unprotected and a closed lock is protected. Similarly, visible sections are indicated by a glasses symbol.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153638	20			0	en-GB	Options				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152773	21			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REGION_TREE\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040501.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue box, in which you can edit the column layout, background, footnote and endnote behaviour of the selected section.\</ahelp\> If the section is password-protected, you must enter the password first.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155143	16			0	en-GB	Remove				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413	17			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_DISMISS\"\>Removes the selected section from the document, and inserts the contents of the section into the document.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Ruler				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149287	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03050000.xhp\" name=\"Ruler\"\>Ruler\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147514	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ruler\"\>Shows or hides the horizontal ruler, that you can use to adjust page margins, tab stops, indents, borders, table cells, and to arrange objects on the page.\</ahelp\> To show the vertical ruler, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</link\>\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	en-GB	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp#ruler\"/\>				20130618 17:22:18
