helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151310	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ViewBounds\"\>Shows or hides the boundaries of the printable area of a page. The boundary lines are not printed.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Field Shadings				20130618 17:22:18
