helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147513	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Marks\"\>Shows or hides field shadings in your document, including non-breaking spaces, custom hyphens, indexes, and footnotes.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153540	17			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Non-printing Characters On/Off\"\>Non-printing Characters On/Off\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
