helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155386	58			0	en-GB	The format contains everything between the beginning of the paragraph and directly after the number-range field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146919	59			0	en-GB	Caption text				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155929	60			0	en-GB	The format contains the text following the number-range field up to the end of the paragraph				20130618 17:22:18
