helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677	16			0	en-GB	Hides a paragraph when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and unmark the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden paragraph\</emph\> check box.				20130618 17:22:18
