helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151255	38			0	en-GB	The variables are displayed in the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> field. When you click the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> button, the dialogue box \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"Input Field\"\>\<emph\>Input Field\</emph\>\</link\> appears, in which you can enter the new value or additional text as a remark.				20130618 17:22:18
