helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153589	146			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box, type: "Addressbook.addresses.forename".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153615	80			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box, type a space and leave the \<emph\>Or\</emph\> box blank.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562	84			0	en-GB	You can now use a condition to insert text based on the contents of the Forename field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150574	147			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> dialogue box, click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150605	85			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> box, click "Conditional text".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277	86			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box, type: Addressbook.addresses.forename == "Michael"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151303	87			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box, type "Dear".				20130618 17:22:18
