helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248	25			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_MAIN_ENTRY\"\>Makes the selected text the main entry in an alphabetical index.\</ahelp\> $[officename] displays the page number of the main entry in a different format than the other entries in the index.				20130618 17:22:18
