helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096	16			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_FROM_COMP_RB\"\>Inserts a reference from the bibliography database.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149805	17			0	en-GB	From document content				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536	18			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_FROM_DOC_RB\"\>Inserts a reference from the bibliography records that are stored in the current document.\</ahelp\> An entry that is stored in the document has priority over an entry that is stored in the bibliography database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200	19			0	en-GB	When you save a document that contains bibliography entries, the corresponding records are automatically saved in a hidden field in the document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143273	5			0	en-GB	Short name				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490	6			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AUTH_MARK_DLG_ID_LISTBOX\"\>Select the short name of the bibliography record that you want to insert.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151260	7			0	en-GB	Author, Title				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149824	8			0	en-GB	If available, the author and the full title of the selected short name are displayed in this area.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149105	9			0	en-GB	Insert				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100	10			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_OK\"\>Inserts the bibliographic reference into the document. If you created a new record, you must also insert it as an entry, otherwise the record is lost when you close the document.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147216	11			0	en-GB	Close				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149036	12			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_CLOSE\"\>Closes the dialogue box.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153634	13			0	en-GB	New				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147579	14			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_AUTH_MRK_CREATE_ENTRY\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120229.xhp\" name=\"Define Bibliography Entry\"\>Define Bibliography Entry\</link\> dialogue box, in which you can create a new bibliography record. This record is only stored in the document. To add a record to the bibliography database, choose \<emph\>Tools - Bibliography Database\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
