helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172	22			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indices_literature.xhp\" name=\"Tips for working with bibliography entries\"\>Tips for working with bibliography entries\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
