helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149880	4			0	en-GB	An inserted script is indicated by a small green rectangle. If you do not see the rectangle, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer/Web - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"View\"\>\<emph\>View\</emph\>\</link\>, and mark the \<emph\>Comments\</emph\> check box. To edit a script, double-click the green rectangle.				20130618 17:22:18
