helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052	2			0	en-GB	The following information concerns Writer styles that you can apply using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015	62			0	en-GB	If you want, you can edit the styles of the current document, and then save the document as a template. To save the document as template, choose \<emph\>File - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"Templates - Save\"\>\<emph\>Templates - Save\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
