helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	en-GB	Character Styles				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	7			0	en-GB	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	en-GB	Paragraph Styles				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810	9			0	en-GB	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308	10			0	en-GB	Frame Styles				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527	11			0	en-GB	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	en-GB	Page Styles				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897	13			0	en-GB	Use Page Styles to organise the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196	63			0	en-GB	Numbering Styles				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	64			0	en-GB	Use Numbering Styles to format numbered or bulleted lists.				20130618 17:22:18
