helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155580	56			0	en-GB	Template Management				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145622	57			0	en-GB	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"Template Management\"\>\<emph\>Template Management\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue box to copy styles from one document to another.				20130618 17:22:18
