helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155896	5			0	en-GB	Applied Style				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149689	17			0	en-GB	Here you can see the list of all Paragraph Styles applied to a context.				20130618 17:22:18
