helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147506				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3147512\" src=\"sfx2/res/styfam2.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147512\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
