helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	57			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OUTLINE_FORM\"\>Saves or loads an outline number format. A saved outline number format is available to all text documents.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150979	58			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Format\</emph\> button is only available for outline numbering. For numbered or bulleted list styles, modify the Numbering Styles of the paragraphs.				20130618 17:22:18
