helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148775	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviewPrintOptions\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens a dialogue box where settings for the printout of your document can be made.\</ahelp\> The pages are proportionally reduced in size. When printing multiple document pages on one printed page, only a portion of the paper may be printed on and a margin may remain.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567	32			0	en-GB	The settings entered on the \<emph\>Print options\</emph\> dialogue box will only be activated if you print out the document using the \<emph\>Print page view\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
