helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312	3			0	en-GB	If you would like to define a different date format, or have the date updated automatically, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> to insert a field command and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialogue box. The format of an existing date field can be modified at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
