helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DiagramData\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Chart Data Table\</emph\> dialogue box in which you can edit the chart data.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667	51			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Chart Data Table\</emph\> dialogue box is not available if you insert a chart that is based on a Calc sheet or on a Writer table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id6746421				0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06990000.xhp\"\>To update a chart manually when a Writer table got changed\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id2565996				0	en-GB	Some changes will become visible only after you close and reopen the dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id6129947				0	en-GB	To change chart data				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id8141117				0	en-GB	When you create a chart that is based on default data, or when you copy a chart into your document, you can open the Chart Data Table dialogue box to enter your own data. The chart responds to the data in a live preview.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9487594				0	en-GB	Close the Chart Data Table dialogue box to apply all changes to the chart. Choose \<emph\>Edit - Undo\</emph\> to cancel the changes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id4149906				0	en-GB	Insert or select a chart that is not based on existing cell data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id6064943				0	en-GB	Choose \<emph\>View - Chart Data Table\</emph\> to open the Chart Data Table dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3236182				0	en-GB	The data series are organised in columns. The role of the leftmost column is set to categories or data labels respectively. The contents of the leftmost column are always formatted as text. You can insert more text columns to be used as hierarchical labels.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9799798				0	en-GB	Click a cell in the dialogue box and change the contents. Click another cell to see the changed contents in the preview.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1251258				0	en-GB	Enter the name of the data series in the text box above the column.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id743430				0	en-GB	Use the icons above the table to insert or delete rows and columns. For data series with multiple columns, only whole data series can be inserted or deleted. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id8111819				0	en-GB	The order of the data series in the chart is the same as in the data table. Use the \<emph\>Move Series Right\</emph\> icon to switch the current column with its neighbour to the right.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id9116794				0	en-GB	The order of the categories or data points in the chart is the same as in the data table. Use the \<emph\>Move Row Down\</emph\> icon to switch the current row with its neighbour below.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150297	20			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new row below the current row.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384	23			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new data series after the current column.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152297				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a new text column after the current column for hierarchical axes descriptions.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159231	26			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the current row. It is not possible to delete the label row.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153336	29			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the current series or text column. It is not possible to delete the first text column.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id4089175				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Switches the current column with its neighbour to the right.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3949095				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Switches the current row with its neighbour below.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
