helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0428200810573991				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable to use the positive error values also as negative error values. You can only change the value of the "Positive (+)" box. That value gets copied to the "Negative (-)" box automatically.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
