helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150539	20			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCH_CT_INDICATE2\"\>Specifies the error indicator.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
