helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147434	1			0	en-GB	Grids				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"gitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can divide the axes into sections by assigning grid lines to them. This allows you to get a better overview of the chart, especially if you are working with large charts.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The y-axis major grid is activated by default.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286	3			0	en-GB	Major grids				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154511	4			0	en-GB	Defines the axis to be set as the major grid.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149400	5			0	en-GB	x-Axis				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	6			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_GRID:CB_X_MAIN\"\>Adds grid lines to the x-axis of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754	7			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"sytextxgitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToggleGridHorizontal\"\>The \<emph\>Horizontal Grid On/Off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar toggles the visibility of the grid display for the x-axis. Note: This only works if the \<emph\>Minor grid\</emph\> check boxes in \<emph\>Insert - Grids\</emph\> are unmarked.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Otherwise, the minor grid remains visible when the major grid is turned off.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145228	8			0	en-GB	y-Axis				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147004	9			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_GRID:CB_Y_MAIN\"\>Adds grid lines to the y-axis of the chart.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344	10			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"sytextygitter\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToggleGridVertical\"\>The \<emph\>Vertical Grid On/Off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar toggles the visibility of the grid display for the y-axis. Note: This only works if the x-Axis \<emph\>Minor grid\</emph\> is not selected in \<emph\>Insert - Grids\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Otherwise, the minor grid remains visible when the major grid is turned off.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166430	11			0	en-GB	z-Axis				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155378	12			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_GRID:CB_Z_MAIN\"\>Adds grid lines to the z-axis of the chart.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if you're working with 3-D charts.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146978	13			0	en-GB	Minor grids				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156449	14			0	en-GB	Use this area to assign a minor grid for each axis. Assigning minor grids to the axis reduces the distance between the major grids.				20130618 17:22:18
