helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154536	18			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_GRID:CB_Y_HELP\"\>Adds grid lines that subdivide the y-axis into smaller sections.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148607	19			0	en-GB	z-Axis				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153247	20			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_GRID:CB_Z_HELP\"\>Adds grid lines that subdivide the z-axis into smaller sections.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if you're working with 3-D charts.				20130618 17:22:18
