helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379	3			0	en-GB	To achieve specific results, you can manually change the axis scaling. For example, you can display only the top areas of the columns by shifting the zero line upwards.				20130618 17:22:18
