helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	bm_id3803827				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>curves;properties in line charts/X-Y charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>properties;smooth lines in line charts/X-Y charts\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id3050325				0	en-GB	Smooth Line Properties				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id9421979				0	en-GB	In a chart that displays lines (Line type or X-Y type), you can choose to show curves instead of straight lines. Some options control the properties of those curves.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id1228370				0	en-GB	To change line properties				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id1601611				0	en-GB	Select Cubic spline or B-spline.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id879848				0	en-GB	These are mathematical models that influence the display of the curves. The cubic spline line passes through all points, while the B-spline line connects the first and last point and passes by the intermediate points.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3464461				0	en-GB	Optionally set the resolution. A higher value leads to a smoother line.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	en-GB	For B-spline lines optionally set the data points order.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3424481				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Apply a cubic spline model.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id1068758				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Apply a B-spline model.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id2320932				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Set the resolution.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id8638874				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Set the data points order.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\three_d_view.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	3-D View 				20130618 17:22:18
