helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147341	1			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"main\"\>\<link href=\"text/smath/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"Instructions for Using $[officename] Math\"\>Instructions for Using $[officename] Math\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
