helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149755	35			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_OPERATORS_CAT\"\>You can choose among various operators to structure your \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> formula. All available operators appear in the lower part of the Formula Elements window.\</ahelp\> They are also listed in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. All operators not contained in the Formula Elements window or in the context menu must be typed manually in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
