helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154752	69			0	en-GB	When typing functions manually in the Commands window, note that spaces are required for some functions (for example, abs 5=5 ; abs -3=3).				20130618 17:22:18
