helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149819	66			0	en-GB	Borders				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149102	67			0	en-GB	Adds a border to your formula. This option is particularly useful if you want to integrate the formula into a text file in $[officename] Writer. When making settings, be sure that you do not use 0 as a size, since this creates viewing problems for text that surrounds the insertion point.				20130618 17:22:18
