helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"symboletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_SYMBOLS_CATALOGUE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Symbols\</emph\> dialogue box, in which you can select a symbol to insert in the formula.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150202	4			0	en-GB	Symbol Set				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699	5			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMBOLDIALOG_1\"\>All symbols are organised into symbol sets. Select the desired symbol set from the list box. The corresponding group of symbols appear in the field below.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917	7			0	en-GB	When a symbol is selected, its command name appears below the symbol list and a magnified version appears in a box to the right. Note that the name must be typed in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window exactly as displayed here (case-sensitive).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126	3			0	en-GB	To insert a symbol, select it from the list and click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. The corresponding command name appears in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154765	8			0	en-GB	Edit				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811	9			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMBOLDIALOG_1\"\>Click here to open the \<link href=\"text/smath/01/06010100.xhp\" name=\"Edit Symbols\"\>Edit Symbols\</link\> dialogue box.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Edit Symbols				20130618 17:22:18
