helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150251	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"formelimportierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImportFormula\" visibility=\"visible\"\>This command opens a dialogue box for importing a formula.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916	3			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialogue box is set up like the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>Open\</link\> dialogue box under \<emph\>File\</emph\>. Use the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialogue box to load, edit and display a formula saved as a file in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Formula Cursor				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149500				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>formula cursor in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cursor; in $[officename] Math\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149500	1			0	en-GB	Formula Cursor				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"cursor\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FORMULACURSOR\"\>Use this icon on the Tools bar to turn the Formula Cursor on or off.\</ahelp\> The part of the formula where the cursor is positioned in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window is marked with a thin border when the formula cursor is active. \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150048	14			0	en-GB	You can also click a position in the document to move the cursor to its corresponding position in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\02\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146966	15			0	en-GB	Double-clicking a character or symbol in the document moves the focus of the cursor to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window and highlights its respective position.				20130618 17:22:18
