helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750	3			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"duplicate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/duplicate_object.xhp\" name=\"Duplicating Objects\"\>Duplicating Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400	4			0	en-GB	You can create duplicate or multiple copies of an object. The copies can be identical or can differ in size, colour, orientation and location.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	5			0	en-GB	The following example creates a stack of coins by making multiple copies of a single ellipse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129	6			0	en-GB	Use the \<emph\>Ellipse\</emph\> tool to draw a solid yellow ellipse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209	8			0	en-GB	Select the ellipse and choose \<emph\>Edit - Duplicate\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145585	9			0	en-GB	Enter 12 as \<emph\>Number of copies.\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151192	11			0	en-GB	Enter a negative value for the \<emph\>Width\</emph\> and \<emph\>Height\</emph\> so that the coins decrease in size as you go up the stack.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387	39			0	en-GB	To define a colour transition for the coins, select different colours in the \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> boxes. The \<emph\>Start\</emph\> colour is applied to the object that you are duplicating.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947	12			0	en-GB	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to create the duplicates.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153935	50			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Duplicate\"\>Edit - Duplicate\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Replacing Colours				20130618 17:22:18
