helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	3			0	en-GB	Locate the picture you want to insert. Mark the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box to insert only a link to the picture. If you want to see the picture before you insert it, select \<emph\>Preview\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764	4			0	en-GB	After you insert a linked picture, do not change the name of the source picture or move the source picture to another directory.				20130618 17:22:18
