helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450	56			0	en-GB	You can select single objects in a group by entering the group. Double-click a group to enter it and click on the object to select it. You can also add or delete objects to and from a group in this mode. The objects that are not part of the group are greyed out.				20130618 17:22:18
