helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010301.xhp\" name=\"Blue Function [Run-time]\"\>Blue Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156343	2			0	en-GB	Returns the blue component of the specified colour code.				20130618 17:22:18
