helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457	4			0	en-GB	Blue (Colour As Long)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149656	5			0	en-GB	Return value:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365	6			0	en-GB	Integer				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156423	7			0	en-GB	Parameter:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448	8			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Colour value:\</emph\> Long integer expression that specifies any \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000003.xhp#farbcodes\" name=\"colour code\"\>colour code\</link\> for which to return the blue component.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153091	9			0	en-GB	Example:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143	10			0	en-GB	Sub ExampleColour				20130618 17:22:18
