helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020404.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020404.xhp\" name=\"Dir Function [Run-time]\"\>Dir Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020404.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381	2			0	en-GB	Returns the name of a file, a directory, or all of the files and the directories on a drive or in a directory that match the specified search path.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020404.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154365	3			0	en-GB	Syntax:				20130618 17:22:18
