helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030103.xhp\" name=\"Day Function [Run-time]\"\>Day Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560	2			0	en-GB	Returns a value that represents the day of the month based on a serial date number generated by \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
