helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344	2			0	en-GB	Returns the minute of the hour that corresponds to the serial time value that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				20130618 17:22:18
