helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153346				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>Second function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153346	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030204.xhp\" name=\"Second Function [Run-time]\"\>Second Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023	2			0	en-GB	Returns an integer that represents the seconds of the serial time number that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				20130618 17:22:18
