helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212	10			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> A numeric expression that represents the ratio of the length of the opposite side to that of the adjacent side of a right-angled triangle. The Atn function returns the corresponding angle in radians (arc tangent).				20130618 17:22:18
