helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550	2			0	en-GB	$[officename] Basic supports the following exponential and logarithmic functions.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Exp Function [Run-time]				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150616				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>Exp function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080201.xhp\" name=\"Exp Function [Run-time]\"\>Exp Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	2			0	en-GB	Returns the base of the natural logarithm (e = 2.71828182845904...) raised to a power.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150984	3			0	en-GB	Syntax:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315	4			0	en-GB	Exp (Number)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347	5			0	en-GB	Return value:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670	6			0	en-GB	Double				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154760	7			0	en-GB	Parameters:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793	8			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> A numeric expression that specifies the power that you want to raise "e" to (the base of natural logarithms). The power must be for both single-precision numbers less than or equal to 88.02969 and double-precision numbers less than or equal to 709.782712893, since $[officename] Basic returns an Overflow error for numbers exceeding these values.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280	9			0	en-GB	Example:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153193	10			0	en-GB	Sub ExampleLogExp				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864	11			0	en-GB	Dim dValue as Double				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145172	12			0	en-GB	const b1=12.345e12				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159254	13			0	en-GB	const b2=1.345e34				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287	14			0	en-GB	dValue=Exp( Log(b1)+Log(b2) )				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3161832	15			0	en-GB	MsgBox "" & dValue & chr(13) & (b1*b2) ,0,"Multiplication by logarithm"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112	16			0	en-GB	end sub				20130618 17:22:18
