helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149416	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080202.xhp\" name=\"Log Function [Run-time]\"\>Log Function [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145066	2			0	en-GB	Returns the natural logarithm of a number.				20130618 17:22:18
