helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080301.xhp	0	help	par_id3148617	22			0	en-GB	MsgBox sText,0,"Spectral Distribution"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080301.xhp	0	help	par_id3152941	23			0	en-GB	end sub				20130618 17:22:18
