helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149416	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090102.xhp\" name=\"Select...Case Statement [Run-time]\"\>Select...Case Statement [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
