helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149205	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090202.xhp\" name=\"For...Next Statement [Run-time]\"\>For...Next Statement [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267	2			0	en-GB	Repeats the statements between the For...Next block a specified number of times.				20130618 17:22:18
