helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147242				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>GoSub...Return statement\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147242	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090301.xhp\" name=\"GoSub...Return Statement [Run-time]\"\>GoSub...Return Statement [Run-time]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316	2			0	en-GB	Calls a subroutine that is indicated by a label from a subroutine or a function. The statements following the label are executed until the next Return statement. Afterwards, the program continues with the statement that follows the \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\> statement.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609	3			0	en-GB	Syntax:				20130618 17:22:18
