helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894	6			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Switch\</emph\> function evaluates the expressions from left to right and then returns the value that is assigned to the function expression. If expression and value are not given as a pair, a run-time error occurs.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	par_id3153990	7			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> The expression that you want to evaluate.				20130618 17:22:18
