helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414	8			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> A numeric expression that you want to convert. If the \<emph\>Expression\</emph\> lies outside the valid long integer range -2,147,483,648 to 2,147,483,647, $[officename] Basic returns an overflow error. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				20130618 17:22:18
