helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686	3			0	en-GB	If the variables are separated by commas (for example, DIM sPar1, sPar2, sPar3 AS STRING), only Variant variables can be defined. Use a separate definition line for each variable.				20130618 17:22:18
