helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729	17			0	en-GB	\<emph\>[Single]:\</emph\> Single floating-point variable (3.402823x10E+38 - 1.401298x10E-45). If no key word is specified, a variable is defined as Single, unless a statement from DefBool to DefVar is used.				20130618 17:22:18
