helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359	9			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Start:\</emph\> Numeric expression that indicates the character position within the string where the string portion that you want to replace or to return begins. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20130618 17:22:18
