helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864	11			0	en-GB	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				20130618 17:22:18
