helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120315.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908	9			0	en-GB	\<emph\>delimiter (optional:\</emph\>) A string character that is used to separate the substrings in the resulting string. The default delimiter is the space character. If delimiter is a string of length zero "", the substrings are joined without separator.				20130618 17:22:18
