helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id4396801				0	en-GB	A motion path can be selected by clicking on the path. A selected path will support handles, it can be moved and resized like a shape. A double-click on a path starts the point edit mode. The point edit mode can also be started by \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Points\</item\> or by pressing \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F8\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
