helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\footer.xhp	0	help	par_id8217413				0	en-GB	When you switch to the master view, you can move that areas to any position on the master. You can enter additional text and resize the areas. You can select the contents of the areas and apply text formats. For example, you can change the font size or colour.				20130618 17:22:18
