helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150260	59			0	en-GB	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Show/Hide Slide\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Using Shortcut Keys in $[officename] Impress				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154702				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>accessibility; $[officename] Impress\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154702	1			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"keyboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"Using Shortcut Keys in $[officename] Impress\"\>Using Shortcut Keys in $[officename] Impress\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610	11			0	en-GB	You can use the keyboard to access $[officename] Impress commands as well as to navigate through the workspace. $[officename] Impress uses the same shortcut keys as $[officename] Draw to create \<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"drawing objects\"\>drawing objects\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149602	18			0	en-GB	Selecting placeholders				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150212	10			0	en-GB	$[officename] Impress \<emph\>AutoLayouts\</emph\> use placeholders for slide titles, text, and objects. To select a placeholder, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\>. To move to the next placeholder, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> again.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3166467	9			0	en-GB	If you press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> after you reach the last placeholder in a slide, a new slide is inserted after the current slide. The new slide uses the same layout as the current slide.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157871	8			0	en-GB	During a Slide Show				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150650	7			0	en-GB	To start a slide show, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+F2\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
