helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154558	3			0	en-GB	Return to previous slide				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590	2			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+PageUp\</item\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153003	12			0	en-GB	Go to a specific slide				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501	13			0	en-GB	Type the page number of the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150337	14			0	en-GB	Slide Sorter				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153732	21			0	en-GB	When you first switch to Slide Sorter, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> to change the keyboard focus to the workspace. Otherwise, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F6\</item\> to navigate to the workspace, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149882	22			0	en-GB	Selecting and deselecting slides				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155930	15			0	en-GB	Use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide that you want to select, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>. To add to the selection, use the arrow keys to navigate to the slide(s) that you want to add, and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\> again. To deselect a slide, navigate to the slide, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Spacebar\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
