helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153810	12			0	en-GB	Drag a data point to resize the line. If a control point overlies the data point, drag the control point until you can see the data point, and then drag the data point.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149872	13			0	en-GB	Drag a control point. The curve pulls in the direction that you drag the control point.				20130618 17:22:18
