helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963	16			0	en-GB	Prepare the slides, start the show using a special icon, tell your imaginary audience what you want to tell for the first slide, then advance to the next slide and so on. $[officename] records the display time for each slide, so the next time that you play the show with automatic slide changes, the timing will be as recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
