helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13150000.xhp\" name=\"Split\"\>Split\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Dismantle\"\>Splits a \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13140000.xhp\" name=\"combined\"\>combined\</link\> object into individual objects.\</ahelp\> The resulting objects have the same line and fill properties as the combined object.				20130618 17:22:18
