helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152900	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Objects3DToolbox\"\>Opens the \<emph\>3-D Objects\</emph\> toolbar. The objects are three dimensional, with depth, illumination, and reflection.\</ahelp\> Each inserted object initially forms a 3-D scene. You can press F3 to enter the scene. For these 3D objects, you can open the 3-D Effects dialogue box to edit the properties.				20130618 17:22:18
