helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	en-GB	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242	27			0	en-GB	To select which properties to include in an AutoFormat, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
