helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210	14			0	en-GB	If you do not see any change in colour of the cell content, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Value Highlighting\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
