helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752	22			0	en-GB	In the Navigator, the source file object appears under "Range names".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754	27			0	en-GB	Using the \<emph\>Drag Mode\</emph\> icon in Navigator, choose whether you want the reference to be a hyperlink, link, or copy.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256	23			0	en-GB	Click the name under "Range names" in the Navigator, and drag into the cell of the current sheet into which you want to insert the reference.				20130618 17:22:18
