helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093E				0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Page Break Preview\</emph\>, print ranges as well as page break regions are outlined by a blue border and contain a centred page number in grey. Non-printing areas have a grey background.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143	8			0	en-GB	To define a new page break region, drag the border to a new location. When you define a new page break region, an automatic page break is replaced by a manual page break.				20130618 17:22:18
