helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082A				0	en-GB	To change the default zoom factor of the \<emph\>Page Break Preview\</emph\>, double-click the percentage value on the \<emph\>Status\</emph\> bar, and select a new zoom factor.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10836				0	en-GB	Edit the print range.				20130618 17:22:18
