helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075	12			0	en-GB	To delete a manual page break that is contained in a print range, drag the border of the page break outside of the print range.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10948				0	en-GB	To clear a print range, drag a border of the range onto the opposite border of the range.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10862				0	en-GB	To exit the \<emph\>Page Break Preview\</emph\>, choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
