helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384	4			0	en-GB	Call the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> when positioned in a cell and choose \<emph\>Selection List\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450	5			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataSelect\"\>A list box containing all text found in the current column is displayed.\</ahelp\> The text is sorted alphabetically and multiple entries are listed only once.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699	6			0	en-GB	Click one of the listed entries to copy it to the cell.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Down				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140100.xhp\" name=\"Down\"\>Down\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillDown\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the top cell of the range.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787	3			0	en-GB	If a selected range has only one column, the contents of the top cell are copied to all others. If several columns are selected, the contents of the corresponding top cell will be copied down.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Right				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140200.xhp\" name=\"Right\"\>Right\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillRight\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the leftmost cell.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	3			0	en-GB	If a range of only one row is selected, the contents of the far left cell are copied to all the other selected cells. If you have selected several rows, each of the far left cells is copied into those cells to the right.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Up				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140300.xhp\" name=\"Up\"\>Up\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillUp\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the bottommost cell.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447	3			0	en-GB	If a selected range has only one column, the content of the bottommost cell is copied into the selected cells. If several columns are selected, the contents of the bottommost cells are copied into those selected above.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Left				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140400.xhp\" name=\"Left\"\>Left\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillLeft\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two columns with the contents of the far right cell.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280	3			0	en-GB	If a selected range has only one row, the content of the far right cell is copied into all other cells of the range. If several rows are selected, the far right cells are copied into the cells to the left.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Fill Sheet				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153897	1			0	en-GB	Fill Sheet				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791	2			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"tabellenfuellentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillTable\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the options for transferring sheets or ranges of a certain sheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767	3			0	en-GB	In contrast to copying an area to the clipboard, you can filter certain information and calculate values. This command is only visible if you have selected two sheets in the document. To select multiple sheets, click each sheet tab while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> or Shift.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155131	4			0	en-GB	Filling a Sheet				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119	5			0	en-GB	Select the entire sheet by clicking the empty grey box in the upper left of the sheet. You can also select an area of the sheet to be copied.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726	6			0	en-GB	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click the tab of the sheet into which you want to insert the contents.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436	7			0	en-GB	Select the command \<emph\>Edit - Fill - Sheet\</emph\>. In the dialogue box which appears, the check box \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> must be selected (or \<emph\>Paste All\</emph\>) if you want to combine operations with the values. You can also choose the desired operation here.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942	8			0	en-GB	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283	9			0	en-GB	This dialogue box is similar to the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Contents\"\>Paste Contents\</link\> dialogue box, in which you can find additional tips.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Fill Series				20130618 17:22:18
