helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146976	41			0	en-GB	Before filling a series, first select the cell range.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748	3			0	en-GB	To automatically continue a series using the assumed completion rules, choose the \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\> option after opening the \<emph\>Fill Series\</emph\> dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147435	4			0	en-GB	Direction				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154729	5			0	en-GB	Determines the direction of series creation.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253	6			0	en-GB	Down				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155418	7			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_BOTTOM\"\>Creates a downward series in the selected cell range for the column using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155738	8			0	en-GB	Right				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149402	9			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_RIGHT\"\>Creates a series running from left to right within the selected cell range using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146972	10			0	en-GB	Up				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153711	11			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_TOP\"\>Creates an upward series in the cell range of the column using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153764	12			0	en-GB	Left				20130618 17:22:18
