helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344	14			0	en-GB	Series Type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	15			0	en-GB	Defines the series type. Choose between \<emph\>Linear, Growth, Date\</emph\> and \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
