helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154739	40			0	en-GB	The term "increment" denotes the amount by which a given value increases.\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_INCREMENT\"\> Determines the value by which the series of the selected type is increased each step.\</ahelp\> Entries can only be made if the linear, growth or date series types have been selected.				20130618 17:22:18
