helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159269				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>DPRODUCT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>multiplying;contents of cells in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
