helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152879	140			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBPRODUKT\"\>DPRODUCT multiplies all cells of a data range for which each cell content matches the search criteria.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
