helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153006	41			0	en-GB	                     \<item type=\"input\"\>Time Period\</item\>                  				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505	42			0	en-GB	                     \<item type=\"input\"\>Deprec. SYD\</item\>                  				20130618 17:22:18
