helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153883	122			0	en-GB	N(Value)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3151101	123			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is the parameter to be converted into a number. N() returns the numeric value if it can. It returns the logical values TRUE and FALSE as 1 and 0 respectively. It returns text and errors as 0.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147097	124			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
