helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150220	206			0	en-GB	Returns a text string that indicates the number format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153824	207			0	en-GB	, = number with thousands separator				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153837	208			0	en-GB	F = number without thousands separator				20130618 17:22:18
