helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153515	211			0	en-GB	P = percentage				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154375	212			0	en-GB	In the above formats, the number of decimal places after the decimal separator is given as a number. Example: the number format #,##0.0 returns ,1 and the number format 00.000% returns P3				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150575	213			0	en-GB	D1 = MMM-D-YY, MM-D-YY and similar formats				20130618 17:22:18
