helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153375	223			0	en-GB	- (Minus) at the end = negative numbers are formatted in colour				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155545	224			0	en-GB	() (brackets) at the end = there is an opening bracket in the format code				20130618 17:22:18
