helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146944				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>ABS function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>absolute values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>values;absolute\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146944	33			0	en-GB	ABS				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154546	34			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ABS\"\>Returns the absolute value of a number.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154843	35			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147475	36			0	en-GB	ABS(Number)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148438	37			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value whose absolute value is to be calculated. The absolute value of a number is its value without the +/- sign.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155823	38			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152787	39			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(-56)\</item\> returns 56.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148752	40			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(12)\</item\> returns 12.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id320139				0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ABS(0)\</item\> returns 0.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150896				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>COUNTBLANK function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>counting;empty cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>empty cells;counting\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
