helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146155	84			0	en-GB	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cotangent is Number.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	en-GB	An error results if Number is in the range -1.0 to +1.0 inclusive.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083452	85			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
