helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3147267	114			0	en-GB	This function returns the inverse trigonometric tangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the angle (in radians) whose tangent is Number. The angle returned is in the range -PI/2 to +PI/2.				20130618 17:22:18
