helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155910	256			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTUNGERADE\"\>Returns TRUE if the value is odd, or FALSE if the number is even.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151006	257			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
