helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149036	685			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_LCM\"\> The result is the lowest common multiple of a list of numbers.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153132	686			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395	687			0	en-GB	LCM_ADD(Number(s))				20130618 17:22:18
