helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3165527	461			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165541	462			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TANH(0)\</item\> returns 0, the hyperbolic tangent of 0.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3165633				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>AutoFilter function; subtotals\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sums;of filtered data\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filtered data; sums\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>SUBTOTAL function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
