helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150290	35			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> is a square array in which the determinants are defined.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11035				0	en-GB	You can find a general introduction to using Array functions on top of this page.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11333				0	en-GB	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20130618 17:22:18
