helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163362	165			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Array1; Array2; ... Array30\</emph\> represent 1 to 30 arrays whose corresponding elements are to be multiplied.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B19				0	en-GB	At least one array must be part of the argument list. If only one array is given, all array elements are summed.				20130618 17:22:18
