helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150877	40			0	en-GB	\<emph\>NoThousandsSeparators\</emph\> (optional) determines whether the thousands separator is used. If the parameter is a number not equal to 0, the thousands separator is suppressed. If the parameter is equal to 0 or if it is omitted, the thousands separators of your \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>current locale setting\</link\> are displayed.				20130618 17:22:18
