helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145208	42			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FIXED(1234567.89;3)\</item\> returns \<emph\>1,234,567.890\</emph\> as a text string. 				20130618 17:22:18
