helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154671	125			0	en-GB	SEARCH("FindText"; "Text"; Position)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146080	126			0	en-GB	\<emph\>FindText\</emph\> is the text string to be searched for.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111	127			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text string in which the search will take place.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149559	128			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text from which the search is to start.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147322	129			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154564	130			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SEARCH(54;998877665544)\</item\> returns 10.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154830				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>SUBSTITUTE function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154830	174			0	en-GB	SUBSTITUTE				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698	175			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WECHSELN\"\>Substitutes new text for old text in a string.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150994	176			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147582	177			0	en-GB	SUBSTITUTE("Text"; "SearchText"; "NewText"; Occurrence)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153675	178			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text string in which text segments are to be exchanged.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155	179			0	en-GB	\<emph\>SearchText\</emph\> is the text segment that is to be replaced (a number of times).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779	180			0	en-GB	\<emph\>NewText\</emph\> is the text string that is to replace the text segment.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150348	181			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Occurrence\</emph\> (optional) indicates which occurrence of the search text is to be replaced. If this parameter is omitted the search text is replaced throughout.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150946	182			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150412	183			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUBSTITUTE("123123123";"3";"abc")\</item\> returns \<emph\>12abc12abc12abc\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154915	238			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUBSTITUTE("123123123";"3";"abc";2)\</item\> returns \<emph\>12312abc123\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
