helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154359	141			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_T\"\>This function returns the target text, or a blank text string if the target is not a text string.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155858	142			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
