helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154726	144			0	en-GB	If \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a text string or refers to a text string, T returns that text string; otherwise it returns a blank text string.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155544	145			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151062	146			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=T(12345)\</item\> returns an empty text string. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id4650105				0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=T("12345")\</item\> returns the text string \<emph\>12345\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147132				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>TEXT function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
