helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147389	162			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the numeric value to be converted.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156167	163			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Format\</emph\> is the text which defines the format. Use decimal and thousands separators according to the language set in the cell format.				20130618 17:22:18
