helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id9044770				0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TEXT(12.34567;"###.##")\</item\> returns the text string \<emph\>12.35\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
