helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3143220	44			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DAYSINYEAR\"\>Calculates the number of days in the year in which the given date occurs.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
