helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3159139	68			0	en-GB	Input: Indicates, for which parameter the description is provided; parameters start at 1. If nParam is 0, the description itself is supposed to be provided in pDesc; in this case, pName does not have any meaning.				20130618 17:22:18
