helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3145245	70			0	en-GB	Output: Takes up the parameter name or type, for example, the word "Number" or "String" or "Date", and so on. Implemented in $[officename] Calc as char[256].				20130618 17:22:18
