helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147096				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>FACTDOUBLE function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>factorials;numbers with increments of two\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
