helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	43			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACTDOUBLE(6)\</item\> returns 48.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id6478469				0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FACTDOUBLE(0)\</item\> returns 1.				20130618 17:22:18
