helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149918	61			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_INTRATE\"\>Calculates the annual interest rate that results when a security (or other item) is purchased at an investment value and sold at a redemption value. No interest is paid.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
