helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147521	315			0	en-GB	\<emph\>EffectiveRate\</emph\> is the effective interest rate				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156334	316			0	en-GB	\<emph\>NumPerYear\</emph\> is the number of periodic interest payments per year.				20130618 17:22:18
