helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159087				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>DOLLARFR function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal fractions, into mixed decimal fractions\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
