helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153795	215			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARFR(1.125;16)\</item\> converts into sixteenths. The result is 1.02 for 1 plus 2/16.				20130618 17:22:18
