helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150941	206			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARDE(1.02;16)\</item\> stands for 1 and 2/16. This returns 1.125.				20130618 17:22:18
