helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151214	140			0	en-GB	A security is purchased on 1999-02-15. It matures on 2007-11-15. The rate of interest is 5.75%. The price is 95.04287 currency units per 100 units of par value, the redemption value is 100 units. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency = 2) and the basis is 0. How high is the yield?				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154194	141			0	en-GB	=YIELD("1999-02-15"; "2007-11-15"; 0.0575; 95.04287; 100; 2; 0) returns 0.065 or 6.50 per cent.				20130618 17:22:18
