helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3163717	163			0	en-GB	A security is purchased on 1999-03-15. It matures on 1999-11-03. The issue date was 1998-11-08. The rate of interest is 6.25%, the price is 100.0123 units. The basis is 0. How high is the yield?				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155311	164			0	en-GB	=YIELDMAT("1999-03-15"; "1999-11-03"; "1998-11-08"; 0.0625; 100.0123; 0) returns 0.060954 or 6.0954 per cent.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149577				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;annuities\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>annuities\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>PMT function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
