helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150334	27			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154508	28			0	en-GB	The entries 2, 4, 6 and eight in the Value 1 ... 4 fields are to be counted.				20130618 17:22:18
