helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3155384	13			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FISHER\"\>Returns the Fisher transformation for x and creates a function close to a normal distribution.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149898	14			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
