helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150432	26			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FISHERINV(0.5)\</item\> yields 0.46.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151390				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>FTEST function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
