helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123	34			0	en-GB	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3159126	35			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FTEST(A1:A30;B1:B12)\</item\> calculates whether the two data sets are different in their variance and returns the probability that both sets could have come from the same total population.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150372				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>FDIST function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
