helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150461	41			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value for which the F-distribution is to be calculated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150029	42			0	en-GB	\<emph\>DegreesFreedom1\</emph\> is the degrees of freedom in the numerator in the F-distribution.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3146877	43			0	en-GB	\<emph\>DegreesFreedom2\</emph\> is the degrees of freedom in the denominator in the F-distribution.				20130618 17:22:18
