helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3145354	74			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GAMMADIST(2;1;1;1)\</item\> yields 0.86.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150272				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>GAUSS function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>normal distribution; standard\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
