helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3155102	114			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_HARMITTEL\"\>Returns the harmonic mean of a data set.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
