helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3148390	70			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the probability value for which the inverse standard logarithmic distribution is to be calculated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3149538	71			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Mean\</emph\> is the arithmetic mean of the standard logarithmic distribution.				20130618 17:22:18
