helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131	30			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Sheet Area\</emph\> box on the Formula bar contains a list of defined names for the ranges. Click a name from this box to highlight the corresponding reference on the spreadsheet. Names given formulae or parts of a formula are not listed here.				20130618 17:22:18
