helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146978	29			0	en-GB	Scale				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149408	30			0	en-GB	Defines a page scale for the printed spreadsheet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN1096D				0	en-GB	Scaling mode				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10971				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:ListBox:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:LB_SCALEMODE\"\>Select a scaling mode from the list box. Appropriate controls will be shown at the side of the list box.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155089	31			0	en-GB	Reduce/enlarge printout				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171	32			0	en-GB	Specifies a scaling factor to scale all printed pages.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099A				0	en-GB	Scaling factor				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152899	36			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_METRICFIELD_RID_SCPAGE_TABLE_ED_SCALEALL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a scaling factor. Factors less than 100 reduce the pages, higher factors enlarge the pages.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B2				0	en-GB	Fit print range(s) to width/height				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B5				0	en-GB	Specifies the maximum number of pages horizontally (width) and vertically (height) on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BB				0	en-GB	The print ranges are always scaled proportionally, so the resulting number of pages may be fewer than specified.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BF				0	en-GB	You may clear one of the boxes, then the unspecified dimension will use as many pages as necessary.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C3				0	en-GB	If you clear both boxes, this will result in a scaling factor of 100%.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CE				0	en-GB	Width in pages				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D1				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:NumericField:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:ED_SCALEPAGEWIDTH\"\>Enter the maximum number of pages to be printed horizontally across.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E8				0	en-GB	Height in pages				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109EB				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:NumericField:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:ED_SCALEPAGEHEIGHT\"\>Enter the maximum number of pages to be printed vertically stacked.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868	33			0	en-GB	Fit print range(s) on number of pages				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145074	34			0	en-GB	Specifies the maximum number of pages on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. The scale will be reduced as necessary to fit the defined number of pages.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	en-GB	Number of pages				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3144507	37			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:ED_SCALEPAGENUM\"\>Enter the maximum number of pages to be printed.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Print Ranges				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154013	1			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05080000.xhp\" name=\"Print Ranges\"\>Print Ranges\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Manages print ranges. Only cells within the print ranges will be printed.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119	4			0	en-GB	If you do not define any print range manually, Calc assigns an automatic print range to include all the cells that are not empty.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729	3			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05080300.xhp\" name=\"Edit\"\>Edit\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
