helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DefinePrintArea\"\>Defines an active cell or selected cell area as the print range.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
