helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AddPrintArea\"\>Adds the current selection to the defined print areas.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
