helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434	2			0	en-GB	Use the Styles and Formatting window to assign styles to objects and text sections. You can update Styles, modify existing Styles or create new Styles.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665	30			0	en-GB	The Styles and Formatting \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dockable window\"\>dockable window\</link\> can remain open while editing the document.				20130618 17:22:18
