helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155961	9			0	en-GB	Formatting				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965	10			0	en-GB	In this section you can select or deselect the available formatting options. If you want to keep any of the settings currently in your spreadsheet, unmark the corresponding option.				20130618 17:22:18
