helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RefreshArrows\"\>Redraws all traces in the sheet. Formulae modified when traces are redrawn are taken into account.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798	3			0	en-GB	Detective arrows in the document are updated under the following circumstances:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192	4			0	en-GB	Starting \<emph\>Tools - Detective - Update Refresh Traces\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030900.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041	5			0	en-GB	If \<emph\>Tools - Detective - Update Automatically\</emph\> is turned on, every time formulae are changed in the document.				20130618 17:22:18
