helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377	33			0	en-GB	If the \<emph\>Regular Expressions\</emph\> check box is marked, you can use regular expressions in the Value field if the Condition list box is set to '=' EQUAL or '<>' UNEQUAL. This also applies to the respective cells that you reference for an advanced filter.				20130618 17:22:18
