helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115	9			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:LB_ACTION\"\>Select the action that you want to occur when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> The "Stop" action rejects the invalid entry and displays a dialogue box that you have to close by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The "Warning" and "Information" actions display a dialogue box that can be closed by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> or \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>. The invalid entry is only rejected when you click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156441	10			0	en-GB	Browse				20130618 17:22:18
