helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3148974	87			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SEKUNDE\"\>Returns the second for the given time value.\</ahelp\> The second is given as an integer in the range 0 to 59.				20130618 17:22:18
