helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350	93			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SECOND(NOW())\</item\> returns the current second				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3150831	94			0	en-GB	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SECOND(C4)\</item\> returns 17 if contents of C4 = \<item type=\"input\"\>12:20:17\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
