helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154073	149			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"time\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_time.xhp\"\>TIME\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3145762	150			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEIT\"\>TIME returns the current time value from values for hours, minutes and seconds.\</ahelp\> This function can be used to convert a time based on these three elements to a decimal time value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155550	151			0	en-GB	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3154584	152			0	en-GB	TIME(Hour; Minute; Second)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3152904	153			0	en-GB	Use an integer to set the \<emph\>Hour\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3151346	154			0	en-GB	Use an integer to set the \<emph\>Minute\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_time.xhp	0	help	par_id3151366	155			0	en-GB	Use an integer to set the \<emph\>Second\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
