helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_today.xhp	0	help	par_id3153759	30			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_HEUTE\"\>Returns the current computer system date.\</ahelp\> The value is updated when you reopen the document or modify values in the document.				20130618 17:22:18
