helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3145144	200			0	en-GB	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> and \<emph\>EndDate\</emph\> are two date values.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3149954	201			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Basis\</emph\> is chosen from a list of options and indicates how the year is to be calculated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3146847	202			0	en-GB	Basis				20130618 17:22:18
