helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148523	7			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"00000140\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find - The Full-Text Search\"\>Find - The Full-Text Search\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
