helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289	11			0	en-GB	The Presentation Wizard starts automatically when you open a new presentation. You can deactivate this function if you choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</emph\> and unmark the \<emph\>Start with Wizard\</emph\> check box.				20130618 17:22:18
