helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152924	9			0	en-GB	Publication type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	10			0	en-GB	Defines the basic settings for the intended export.				20130618 17:22:18
