helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10575				0	en-GB	Licence				20130618 17:22:18
