helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard01.xhp	0	help	par_idN10554				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use the Web Wizard to maintain web pages on a server.\</ahelp\> You can also load previously saved Web Wizard settings to maintain an existing web page. These settings include information about the local folder and the FTP server.				20130618 17:22:18
