helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\accessibility.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771	11			0	en-GB	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link name=\"%PRODUCTNAME - Accessibility\" href=\"text/shared/optionen/01013000.xhp\"\>\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> - Accessibility\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
