helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	en-GB	Using forms, you can define how to present the data. Open a text document or a spreadsheet and insert the controls such as push buttons and list boxes. In the properties dialogue boxes of the controls, you can define what data the forms should display.				20130618 17:22:18
