helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265	14			0	en-GB	%PRODUCTNAME stores the information about the created reports in the database file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758	15			0	en-GB	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the database file that you want to create the report for.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054	16			0	en-GB	In the database file window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280	18			0	en-GB	Double-click one of the report names to open the report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	en-GB	These links are added automatically when you create a new report by the Report Wizard or in the Report Builder window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id1695608				0	en-GB	Editing a Report Created in the Report Builder Window				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id7510910				0	en-GB	Right-click the name of a report in the database file window, then choose Edit.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id8138065				0	en-GB	The Report Builder window opens with the report's information loaded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id5086825				0	en-GB	Use the toolbars and menu commands and drag-and-drop to edit the report as stated in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id4747154				0	en-GB	Execute the report to see the resulting report document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153104	19			0	en-GB	Editing a Report Created by the Report Wizard				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863	20			0	en-GB	On the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100500.xhp\" name=\"last dialogue box page of the Report Wizard\"\>last dialogue box page of the Report Wizard\</link\>, you can choose to edit the report template before you use the report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431	22			0	en-GB	You can edit the page styles for the first page and the following pages of the report as well as the paragraph styles, the number formats, the printed field labels, and more.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D7				0	en-GB	Unless you have a thorough understanding of the database the report accesses, do not edit the SQL statement, database name, the hidden form controls, or the related information on the report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Creating Reports				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	bm_id3729667				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating reports\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>reports;creating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wizards;reports\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"data_reports\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_reports.xhp\"\>Creating Reports\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	en-GB	A report is a Writer text document that can show your data in an organised order and formatting. In %PRODUCTNAME Base, you have a choice to create a report either manually using drag-and-drop in the Report Builder window, or semi-automatically by following a series of dialogue boxes in the Report Wizard.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4094363				0	en-GB	The following list gives you some information to decide which method to use for your data:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8514358				0	en-GB	Report Builder				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id9764091				0	en-GB	Report Wizard				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1579638				0	en-GB	Started by "Create Report in Design View" command.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1886959				0	en-GB	Started by "Use Wizard to Create Report" command.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id455030				0	en-GB	Full flexibility to use report headers and footers, page headers and footers, multi-column reports.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8409985				0	en-GB	Uses a Writer template to generate a report document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5931272				0	en-GB	Use drag-and-drop to position the record fields or other design elements like pictures or lines.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id9869075				0	en-GB	Select from several given choices to arrange the data records.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8611713				0	en-GB	Generates a one-time snapshot of the data. To see an updated report, execute the same report again to create a Writer document with the updated data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2866908				0	en-GB	You can choose to generate a one-time snapshot with fixed data, or a "live" report with links to the current data at the time when you open the Base file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4169743				0	en-GB	Saves the report as a Writer text document. Stores the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id408948				0	en-GB	Saves the report and the information how to create the report inside the Base file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id2891933				0	en-GB	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to create a new report with the current data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id6142765				0	en-GB	Choose Open in the context menu or double-click the report name to either see again the static snapshot of the data from first creation time, or to create a new report with the current data. This depends on your choice on the last page of the wizard.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id1757560				0	en-GB	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to open the Report Builder window, with the report's information loaded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4649189				0	en-GB	Choose Edit in the context menu of a report name to edit the Writer template file that was used to create the report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	hd_id8414258				0	en-GB	Creating a New Report Manually In Design View				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id3119602				0	en-GB	Open the database file in which you want to create the new report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4226508				0	en-GB	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5758842				0	en-GB	Click \<emph\>Create Report in Design View\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
