helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_autosave.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760	11			0	en-GB	Mark \<emph\>Save AutoRecovery information every\</emph\> and select the time interval.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_autosave.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526	13			0	en-GB	This command saves the information necessary to restore the current document in case of a crash. Additionally, in case of a crash %PRODUCTNAME tries automatically to save AutoRecovery information for all open documents, if possible.				20130618 17:22:18
