helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201	15			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"dragdrop_graphic\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/dragdrop_graphic.xhp\" name=\"Copying Graphics Between Documents\"\>Copying Graphics Between Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805	16			0	en-GB	You can copy a graphic from one document to another by drag-and-drop. If you plan to publish your document, please observe copyright laws and obtain the consent of the authors.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576	17			0	en-GB	Open the document in which you want to insert the graphic object.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338	18			0	en-GB	Open the document from which you want to copy the graphic.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182	19			0	en-GB	Click the graphic while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, to select it without executing any hyperlinks it may refer to.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3151110	20			0	en-GB	Keep the mouse button pressed and wait a moment while the object is copied to an internal memory.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763	21			0	en-GB	Drag the graphic into the other document. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>If the documents are not visible side by side, first move the mouse pointer to the button of the target document while keeping the mouse button pressed. The document in question is then displayed and you can move the mouse pointer into the document.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628	22			0	en-GB	Release the mouse button as soon as the grey text cursor indicates the position where you want to insert a copy of the picture.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276	56			0	en-GB	If the graphic is connected with a hyperlink, the hyperlink and not the graphic is inserted.				20130618 17:22:18
