helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id2307199				0	en-GB	You can combine several graphic objects into a group so that you can use them like a single object.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id9983825				0	en-GB	You can move, transform, resize, distort, or convert all objects in a group together, and you can enter the group any time to change the individual objects.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id5734733				0	en-GB	You can change the properties (line size, fill colour, and more) of all objects in a group together, and you can enter the group and change the individual objects.				20130618 17:22:18
