helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154898	9			0	en-GB	Converting all documents of a folder				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336	10			0	en-GB	Open the wizard, which guides you through the operation, to copy and convert all documents from Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel or Microsoft PowerPoint into OpenDocument file format documents. You can select a source and target directory, specify whether to convert documents and/or templates, and more besides.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3153824	11			0	en-GB	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01130000.xhp\" name=\"File - Wizards - Document Converter\"\>\<emph\>File - Wizards - Document Converter\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	hd_id4563127				0	en-GB	Opening HTML files in Writer				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id9207434				0	en-GB	Choose the file type "HTML Document" to open in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer/Web. This is the default for HTML documents in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id7215491				0	en-GB	All the options of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer/Web are now available to you, such as \<emph\>Show HTML source\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id2299874				0	en-GB	Choose "HTML Document (\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer)" to open in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id1727347				0	en-GB	All the options of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer are now available to you. Not all options that \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer offers for editing of documents can be saved in HTML format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944	12			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01130100.xhp\" name=\"Working with VBA code\"\>Working with VBA code\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264	13			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Setting the default file format\"\>Setting the default file format\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
