helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	en-GB	Contents that are stored on the clipboard can be pasted into your document using different formats. In %PRODUCTNAME you can choose how to paste the contents using a dialogue box or a drop-down icon.				20130618 17:22:18
