helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	en-GB	Select any combination of the four options, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	en-GB	All documents that you print from now on will use the changed options.				20130618 17:22:18
