helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	en-GB	You can reduce data for transparency, for gradients, or for bitmaps. When you reduce the data, on many printers you will not see a reduction of printing quality. But the printing time is substantially shorter, and when you print to a file, the file size is much smaller.				20130618 17:22:18
