helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Recording and Displaying Changes				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150499				0	en-GB	\<bookmark_value\>marking changes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>highlighting changes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changes; review function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>review function; recording changes example\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Track Changes, see review function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
