helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	27			0	en-GB	You can set a tab stop by clicking on the ruler or by selecting \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Tabs.\</emph\> Both methods affect the current paragraph or all selected paragraphs.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136	5			0	en-GB	Click the ruler once to set a left-justified tab. Right-click a tab icon on the ruler to see the context menu in which you can change the tab type.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	29			0	en-GB	To set several decimal tabs one after the other, keep clicking the icon to the left of the ruler until the desired tab type is shown, then click on the ruler.				20130618 17:22:18
