helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145	12			0	en-GB	Double-click the white area of the ruler to set one tab. The \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> dialogue box appears with the \<emph\>Tabs\</emph\> tab page open.				20130618 17:22:18
