helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399	1			0	en-GB	File properties, such as author name, subject, and keywords, help you manage and identify your documents. $[officename] also tracks file statistics, including the number of words and the number of pages in a document, and automatically adds the statistics as part of the file property.				20130618 17:22:18
