helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	14			0	en-GB	The width of a data field in the exported text file is set to the current width of the corresponding column.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3154116	15			0	en-GB	Values are exported in the format as currently seen in the cell.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000207.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414	16			0	en-GB	If a value is longer than the fixed column width, it will be exported as a ### string.				20130618 17:22:18
