helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3470564				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches from top to bottom through the columns.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
