helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145619	197			0	en-GB	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>Searches through all of the sheets in the current spreadsheet file.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20130618 17:22:18
