helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934	53			0	en-GB	This \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> dialogue box is only available for Fontwork in old Writer text documents that were created prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION. You must first call \<emph\>Tools - Customise\</emph\> to add a menu command or an icon to open this dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154497	74			0	en-GB	You can change the shape of the text baseline to match semicircles, arcs, circles, and free-form lines.				20130618 17:22:18
