helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154926	17			0	en-GB	The exceptions that you define depend on the current language setting. If you want, you can change the language setting by selecting a different language in the \<emph\>Replacements and exceptions for language\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
