helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3146857	3			0	en-GB	You can save some passwords for the duration of a session, or permanently to a file protected by a master password.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3147000	6			0	en-GB	You must enter the master password to access a file or service that is protected by a saved password. You only need to enter the master password once during a session.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\password_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0608200910545958				0	en-GB	You should only use passwords that are hard to find by other persons or programs. A password should follow these rules:				20130618 17:22:18
