helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id4809411				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The bookmarks (targets of references) in PDF files can be defined as rectangular areas. Additionally, bookmarks to named objects can be defined by their names. Mark the check box to export the names of objects in your document as valid bookmark targets. This allows to link to those objects by name from other documents.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
