helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147046	7			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Pushbutton\"\>Creates a push button.\</ahelp\> This function can be used to execute a command for a defined event, such as a mouse click.				20130618 17:22:18
