helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10D0D				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0226.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Form Design\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B57				0	en-GB	Wizards On/Off				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B65				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id6128727\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_usewizards.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6128727\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B76				0	en-GB	Turns on and turns off the automatic form controls wizards.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id6403088				0	en-GB	These wizards help you to enter the properties of list boxes, table controls, and other controls.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149436	134			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170001.xhp\" name=\"Context Menu Commands\"\>Context Menu Commands\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A56				0	en-GB	Spin Button				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A64				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id7816400\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_spinbutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7816400\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A75				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpinButton\"\>Creates a spin button.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id710776				0	en-GB	If you add a spin button to a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between the spin button and a cell. As a result, when you change the content of a cell, the contents of the spin button are updated. Conversely, if you change the value of the spin button, the contents of the cell are updated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ABC				0	en-GB	Scrollbar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ACA				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id8203985\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_scrollbar.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id8203985\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ADB				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ScrollBar\"\>Creates a scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CA3				0	en-GB	You can specify the following properties for a scrollbar:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CDA				0	en-GB	UI name				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE0				0	en-GB	Semantics				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	en-GB	Scroll value min				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	en-GB	Specifies the minimum height or the minimum width of a scrollbar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	en-GB	Scroll value max				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	en-GB	Specifies the maximum height or the maximum width of a scrollbar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	en-GB	Default scroll value				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	en-GB	Specifies the default value of a scrollbar, used when the form is reset.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	en-GB	Orientation				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	en-GB	Specifies the orientation of a scrollbar, that is, horizontal or vertical.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	en-GB	Small change				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	en-GB	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	en-GB	Large change				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	en-GB	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	en-GB	Delay				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	en-GB	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	en-GB	Symbol colour				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	en-GB	Specifies the colour of the arrows on the scrollbar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	en-GB	Visible Size				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	en-GB	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	en-GB	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	en-GB	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153316	22			0	en-GB	Image Button				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159622				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3154378\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_imagebutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154378\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601	23			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159171	49			0	en-GB	Image Control				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155869				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3152381\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_imagecontrol.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152381\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596	50			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImageControl\"\>Creates an image control. It can only be used to add images from a database.\</ahelp\> In the form document, double-click one of these controls to open the \<emph\>Insert Graphic\</emph\> dialogue box to insert the image. There is also a context menu (not in design mode) with commands for inserting and deleting the image.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150318	70			0	en-GB	Images from a database can be displayed in a form, and new images can be inserted in the database as long as the image control is not write-protected. The control must refer to a database field of the image type. Therefore, enter the data field into the properties window on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156040	29			0	en-GB	Date Field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149423				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3150096\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_adddatefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150096\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312	30			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DateField\"\>Creates a date field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the date values can be adopted from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151302	131			0	en-GB	If you assign the "drop-down" property to the date field, the user can open a calendar to select a date under the date field. This also applies to a date field within a Table Control field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395	63			0	en-GB	Date fields can be easily edited by the user with the up arrow and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the day, month, or the year is can be increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112	132			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170003.xhp\" name=\"Specific Remarks on Date Fields\"\>Specific Remarks on Date Fields\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152369	31			0	en-GB	Time Field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153687				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3155949\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_timefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155949\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155399	32			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TimeField\"\>Creates a time field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the time values for the form can be adopted from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154764	64			0	en-GB	Time fields can be easily edited by the user with the up and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the hours, minutes, or the seconds are increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156186	27			0	en-GB	File Selection				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150531				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3154344\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_filecontrol.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154344\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438	28			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FileControl\"\>Creates a button that enables file selection.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
