helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601	34			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numeric field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numeric values in the form can be adopted from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
