helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B2C				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id5074922\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigationbar.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5074922\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B3D				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NAVIGATIONBAR\"\>Creates a navigation bar.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DB1				0	en-GB	The navigation bar allows you to move through the records of a database or a database form. The controls on this navigation bar work the same way as the controls on the default \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\"\>navigation bar\</link\> in $[officename].				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146815	136			0	en-GB	Automatic Control Focus				20130618 17:22:18
