helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148873	102			0	en-GB	The characters a-z, A-Z, and 0-9 can be entered. Capital characters are not converted to lower-case characters.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153781	103			0	en-GB	C				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154574	104			0	en-GB	The characters A-Z and 0-9 can be entered. If a lower-case letter is entered, it is automatically converted to a capital letter				20130618 17:22:18
