helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1156E				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you set this option to "Yes", the Push Button receives the focus when you click the button.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11578				0	en-GB	Hide selection				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1158E				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"37965\"\>Specifies whether a text selection on a control remains selected when a the focus is no longer on a control.\</ahelp\> If you set \<emph\>Hide selection\</emph\> to "No", the selected text remains selected when the focus is no longer on the control that contains the text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11598				0	en-GB	Style				20130618 17:22:18
