helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894	5			0	en-GB	You can edit the URL and insert it at the current cursor position in the active document with the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon. The \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon can only be activated if the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field contains text.				20130618 17:22:18
