helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RemoveFilterSort\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Cancels the filter settings and displays all of the records in the current table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
