helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Refresh\"\>Refreshes the displayed data.\</ahelp\> In a multi-user environment, refreshing the data ensures that it remains current.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147261				0	en-GB	\<image id=\"img_id3153910\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_reload.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153910\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
