helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	4			0	en-GB	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Refresh\</emph\> icon to open a sub-menu with the following commands:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426	5			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Refresh\</emph\> - Displays the refreshed contents of the database table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	6			0	en-GB	\<emph\>Rebuild\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_BROWSER_REFRESH_REBUILDVIEW\"\>Rebuilds the view of the database table. Use this command when you have changed the structure of the table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	en-GB	Insert Database Columns				20130618 17:22:18
