helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150976	14			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>Value\</emph\> list box contains all possible values for the specified \<emph\>Field name\</emph\>. Choose the value to be used in the filter. You can also choose the \<emph\>- empty -\</emph\> or \<emph\>-not empty -\</emph\> entries..				20130618 17:22:18
