helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148620	14			0	en-GB	If you sort the field name "Forename" in ascending order and the field name "Surname" in descending order, all records will be sorted in ascending order by forename, and then within the forenames, in descending order by surname.				20130618 17:22:18
