helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151054	65			0	en-GB	New Dictionary				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360	66			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Dictionary\</emph\> section you can name a new user-defined dictionary or dictionary of exceptions and specify the language.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398	67			0	en-GB	Name				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192	68			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:ED_DICTNAME\"\>Specifies the name of the new custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> The file extension "*.DIC" is automatically appended.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150767	69			0	en-GB	Language				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920	70			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:LB_DICTLANG\"\>By selecting a certain language you can limit the use of the custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> By selecting \<emph\>All\</emph\> the custom dictionary is used independently of the current language.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153106	71			0	en-GB	Exceptions (-)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561	72			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:BTN_EXCEPT\"\>Specifies whether you wish to avoid certain words in your documents.\</ahelp\> In this way, you can create a custom dictionary of all the words to be avoided. If this exception dictionary is activated, during spell checking you will receive a corresponding note about any words which should be avoided.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785	73			0	en-GB	Edit				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576	74			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SFXPAGE_LINGU_PB_LINGU_DICS_EDIT_DIC\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Edit custom dictionary\</emph\> dialogue box, in which you can add to your custom dictionary or edit existing entries.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436	75			0	en-GB	In the \<emph\>Edit custom dictionary\</emph\> dialogue box you have the option to enter new terms or edit existing entries. If you edit an exception dictionary, the dialogue box has the added facility of defining an exception for a word. During the spell check this exception is then listed as a suggestion.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750	76			0	en-GB	When a dictionary is edited, a check is made on the status of the file. If the file is write-protected, it cannot be changed. The buttons \<emph\>New\</emph\> and \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> are then deactivated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150116	77			0	en-GB	Book				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394	78			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:LB_ALLDICTS\"\>Specifies the book to be edited.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730	79			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"ignore\"\>The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList (All)\</emph\> includes all words that have been marked with \<emph\>Ignore\</emph\> during a spell check. This list is valid only for the current spell check. \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757	80			0	en-GB	The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList\</emph\> entry cannot be selected and cannot be deleted. Only the words included as content can be deleted. This happens automatically each time that $[officename] is closed.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018	81			0	en-GB	Language				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255	82			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:LB_DICTLANG\"\>Assigns a new language to the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151189	83			0	en-GB	Word				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151252	84			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:ED_WORD\"\>You can type a new word for inclusion in the dictionary. In the list below you will see the contents of the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> If you select a word from this list it is displayed in the text field. If you type a word with an equals sign after it, such as "AutoComplete=", the word is neither automatically hyphenated nor is a hyphenation suggested. Typing "Auto=Complete" result in the word being hyphenated, or a hyphenation suggested, at the point where you insert the = sign.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155175	85			0	en-GB	Suggestion				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147323	86			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:ED_REPLACE\"\>This input field is only available if you are editing an exception dictionary. The field shows the alternative suggestion for the current word in the "Word" text box.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147361	88			0	en-GB	New				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808	89			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:PB_NEW_REPLACE\"\>Adds the word in the \<emph\>Word\</emph\> text field to your current custom dictionary. The word in the \<emph\>Suggestion\</emph\> field is also added when working with exception dictionaries.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790	91			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Removes the marked word from the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277	93			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected dictionary after a confirmation, provided it is not write-protected.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
