helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150983	43			0	en-GB	Check upper-case words				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582	44			0	en-GB	Specifies that capitalisation is checked during a spell check.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150826	45			0	en-GB	Check words with numbers.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208	46			0	en-GB	Specifies that words that contain numbers as well as letters are to be checked.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147509	47			0	en-GB	Check capitalisation				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200	48			0	en-GB	Checks for the correct use of capitals at the beginning of words during a spell check.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166424	49			0	en-GB	Check special regions				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345	50			0	en-GB	Specifies that special regions, such as drawing text, text in headers and footers, document tables, and text frames, are checked during a spell check.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166429	21			0	en-GB	Check spelling as you type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	6			0	en-GB	\<variable id=\"automatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpellOnline\"\>Automatically checks spelling as you type, and underlines errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291	32			0	en-GB	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of suggested corrections. Select a suggested correction to replace the suspect word with the suggestion. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815	23			0	en-GB	To place the word pair in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect replacement table\"\>AutoCorrect replacement table\</link\>, open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040500.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect context menu\"\>AutoCorrect context menu\</link\> and choose \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\>. Make your selection from the sub-menu. The word is replaced and at the same time the word pair is placed in the replacement table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150111	53			0	en-GB	Minimum number of characters for hyphenation				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150316	54			0	en-GB	Specifies the minimum number of characters required for automatic hyphenation to be applied. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_LNGDLG_NUM_PREBREAK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Type the minimum number of characters that must come before or after the hyphen.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148823	11			0	en-GB	Characters before line break				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029	12			0	en-GB	Sets the minimum number of characters that must remain at the end of the line when hyphenating a word.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154956	13			0	en-GB	Characters after line break				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149439	14			0	en-GB	Specifies the minimum number of characters required on the next line when hyphenating a word.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156337	15			0	en-GB	Hyphenate without inquiry				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130	16			0	en-GB	Specifies that you will never be prompted for manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognised you will be presented with a dialogue box for entering hyphens.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155900	17			0	en-GB	Hyphenate special regions				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098	18			0	en-GB	Specifies that hyphenation will also be carried out in footnotes, headers and footers.				20130618 17:22:18
