helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778802				0	en-GB	Click any of the six option buttons Red, Green, Blue, Hue, Saturation, or Brightness. The colour slider changes to show the available range of values. \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorSlider\"\>In the colour slider, you will see the range of values that you can change, depending on the selected option button. Click inside the colour slider to change values in the big colour field.\</ahelp\>        				20130618 17:22:18
