helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444	71			0	en-GB	Transparency cannot be output directly to a printer. The areas of the document in which transparency is to be visible must therefore always be calculated as bitmaps and sent to the printer. Depending on the size of the bitmaps and the print resolution a large amount of data may result.				20130618 17:22:18
