helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943	9			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_SSO_ED_USERNAME\"\>Using "simple" authentication method, you enter your user name on the LDAP server here.\</ahelp\> Using "Kerberos", you just see your user name, but cannot edit it.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153061	5			0	en-GB	Password				20130618 17:22:18
