helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795	6			0	en-GB	Save password				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358	11			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_SSO_CB_PASSWORD\"\>Using "simple" authentication method, mark this check box to make your password persistent.\</ahelp\> If the password is persistent and the same user starts $[officename] later on, the user name and password will not be requested again. Using "Kerberos", this box is not active.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939	12			0	en-GB	The password will be stored encrypted in a file called .ssop in your \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>home directory \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>"My Documents" folder\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20130618 17:22:18
