helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id5319071				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Type the name of the proxy server for HTTPS. Type the port in the right-hand field.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150543	33			0	en-GB	FTP proxy				20130618 17:22:18
