helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797	28			0	en-GB	Defines the defaults for all newly created text tables in text documents.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152922	29			0	en-GB	Heading				20130618 17:22:18
