helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146976	37			0	en-GB	Input in tables				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153142	39			0	en-GB	Number recognition				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481	40			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFORMATTING\"\>Specifies that numbers in a text table are recognised and formatted as numbers.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306	41			0	en-GB	If \<emph\>Number recognition\</emph\> is not marked, numbers are saved in text format and are automatically left-aligned.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856	42			0	en-GB	Number format recognition				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159346	43			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFMT_FORMATTING\"\>If \<emph\>Number format recognition\</emph\> is not marked, only input in the format that has been set at the cell is accepted. Any other input resets the format to \<emph\>Text\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153876	44			0	en-GB	Alignment				20130618 17:22:18
