helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792	46			0	en-GB	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you centre align the cell content directly, it remains centred irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				20130618 17:22:18
