helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	6			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_OPTSHDWCRSR:CB_SHDWCRSONOFF\"\>Activates the direct cursor.\</ahelp\> You can also activate this function by clicking the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18130000.xhp\" name=\"Direct Cursor On/Off\"\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Direct Cursor On/Off\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> icon in a text document.				20130618 17:22:18
