helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154286	33			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_LISTBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_LB_COLOR\"\>Specifies a colour for the grid lines in the current document.\</ahelp\> To see the grid line colour that was saved with the document, go to \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME\</emph\>\<emph\>- Appearance\</emph\>, under \<emph\>Scheme\</emph\> find the entry \<emph\>Spreadsheet - Grid lines\</emph\> and set the colour to "Automatic".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152349	34			0	en-GB	Page breaks				20130618 17:22:18
