helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154205	46			0	en-GB	Horizontal scrollbar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155578	47			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_HSCROLL\"\>Specifies whether to display a horizontal scrollbar at the bottom of the document window.\</ahelp\> Note that there is a slider between the horizontal scrollbar and the sheet tabs that may be set to one end.				20130618 17:22:18
