helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150826	50			0	en-GB	Sheet tabs				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658	51			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_TBLREG\"\>Specifies whether to display the sheet tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet document.\</ahelp\> If this check box is not marked, you will only be able to switch between the sheets through the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Navigator\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Note that there is a slider between the horizontal scrollbar and the sheet tabs that may be set to one end.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152584	52			0	en-GB	Outline symbols				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145135	53			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_OUTLINE\"\>If you have defined an \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080000.xhp\" name=\"outline\"\>outline\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>outline\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, the \<emph\>Outline symbols\</emph\> option specifies whether to view the outline symbols at the border of the sheet.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
