helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	2			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS\"\>All user-defined lists are displayed in the \<emph\>Sort Lists\</emph\> dialogue box. You can also define and edit your own lists. Only text can be used as sort lists, no numbers.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
