helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214	24			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically  moved to the end of the previous line.  For example, an exclamation mark at the end of a sentence never appears at the beginning of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				20130618 17:22:18
