helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\viewcertificate.xhp	0	help	par_idN10545				0	en-GB	The View Certificate dialogue box opens when you click the View Certificate button on the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity_ts.xhp\"\>Trusted Sources\</link\> tab page of the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity.xhp\"\>Macro Security\</link\> dialogue box.				20130618 17:22:18
