helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	25			0	en-GB	In design mode, the form is designed and the properties of the form and the controls contained in it are defined.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149784	30			0	en-GB	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Sorting and Filtering Data\"\>Sorting and Filtering Data\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\04000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384	28			0	en-GB	You will find the sorting and filter functions in the toolbar when you open a form in user mode.				20130618 17:22:18
