helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178	8			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_RADIOBUTTON_TAB_WIZ_COPYTABLE_RB_DEFDATA\"\>Creates a 1:1 copy of the database table.\</ahelp\> The table definition and the complete data are copied. The table definition includes the table structure and format from different data fields, including special field properties. The field contents supply the data.				20130618 17:22:18
