helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275	13			0	en-GB	The table definition must be exactly the same so that data can be copied. Data cannot be copied if a data field in the target table has a different format than the data field in the source table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117	31			0	en-GB	Match the data field names in the \<emph\>Copy Table\</emph\> dialogue box on the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05030400.xhp\" name=\"Apply Columns\"\>Apply Columns\</link\> page.				20130618 17:22:18
