helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027	2			0	en-GB	In the data source explorer, you can copy a table by dragging-and-dropping the table onto the table container. If you mark the \<emph\>Attach data\</emph\> check box on the first page of the \<emph\>Copy table\</emph\> dialogue box, the \<emph\>Assign columns\</emph\> dialogue box opens as the second window. You can use this dialogue box to map the content of a data field in the source table to a different data field in the destination table.				20130618 17:22:18
