helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071	5			0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_NAMEMATCHING_COLS_AVAIL\"\>Lists the data fields in the source table. To include a data field from the source table in the destination table, mark the check box in front of the data field name. To map the content of a data field in the source table to a different data field in the destination table, click the data field in the source table list, and then click the up or down arrow.\</ahelp\> To include all of the source data fields in the destination table, click \<emph\>All\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410	6			0	en-GB	Destination table				20130618 17:22:18
