helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	en-GB	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Only allows characters that conform to the SQL-92 naming convention in a name in a data source. All other characters are rejected. Each name must begin with a lower-case letter, an upper-case letter, or an underscore ( _ ). The remaining characters can be ASCII letters, numbers, and underscores.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105907				0	en-GB	Use keyword AS before table alias names				20130618 17:22:18
