helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D6				0	en-GB	Some databases assign version numbers to fields to track changes to records. The version number of a field is incremented by one each time that the content of the field is changed. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_DSADMIN_SUPPRESS_VERSIONCL\"\>Displays the internal version number of the record in the database table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
