helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ado.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	en-GB	The ADO interface is a Microsoft Windows proprietary container for connecting to databases.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ado.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	en-GB	$[officename] requires the Microsoft Data Access Components (MDAC) to use the ADO interface. Microsoft Windows 2000 and XP include these components by default. For earlier visions of Windows, you need to install MDAC separately. You can download MDAC from the Microsoft web site.				20130618 17:22:18
