helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6993926				0	en-GB	The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page can be used to change the name of the report, and to disable the Page Header or Page Footer areas, among others.				20130618 17:22:18
